      "text": "As the year comes to a close, we still have the most secure border of my lifetime thanks to the unwavering leadership of President Trump and his dedication to making America safe and prosperous. Recently, I was able to travel with CBP Commissioner Rodney Scott to several sites along the SW Border to thank those on the frontlines who made this achievement happen and continue to work tirelessly every day to protect our country and ensure the border is secure. A secure border saves lives and a secure border strengthens our national security. @CBP\n@CBPCommissioner @WhiteHouse",
